stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NeedsRouting: spawn / dynamic arrival
    NeedsRouting --> WaitingForPickup: routed to a machine
    WaitingForPickup --> InTransit: AGV picks up
    InTransit --> Queued: AGV delivers
    Queued --> Processing: dispatched from queue
    Processing --> NeedsRouting: op done, more remain
    Processing --> WaitingForPickup: final op done
    WaitingForPickup --> InTransit: AGV → outgoing belt
    InTransit --> [*]: delivered → Exited
    WaitingForPickup --> NeedsRouting: AGV stall recovery
    InTransit --> NeedsRouting: AGV stall recovery
